      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports that a Y-maze was used in mice as part of tasks assessing declarative memory, but it does not provide a definition of a “maze” as having a “structured set of paths or choices.”",
        "The packet does not explicitly state that mazes are used to study how an animal explores (rather, it describes using open field for exploratory behavior and mentions an “exploration rate” in relation to other task performance).",
